# Vendored third-party dependencies (glm / glfw / assimp / freetype / tinygltf /
# stb_image / tiny_obj_loader) are deliberately versioned: the framework
# extension layer in extensions/ must build from a fresh clone with no external
# SDK checkout.  Only transient local backups are ignored.
/external/*.bak
/external/**/*.bak
.externalNativeBuild
.vscode
*.doc
*.docx
/shader/*.hpp
# 渲染调试存盘（Debug View / PPM dump，见 DESIGN.md 13.4）
/dump
**/dump
# raw2rgb 示例的运行产物（见 DESIGN.md 32.6）：合成输入副本 + 解包/转 RGB 的输出，
# 全部可由 --width/--height 与合成图案确定性重算，不入库；目录本身由示例自行创建
/assets/images/input_raw12_*.raw
/assets/images/output_unpack_raw16_*.raw
/assets/images/output_rgb_*.ppm
